{
  "schema": "loadsketch/brief@1",
  "id": "brief-geocode",
  "title": "Brief: address lookup",
  "text": "A team of 2, two weeks. Build an address lookup API: an address in, coordinates out. An outside map provider finds the coordinates; it is on the canvas already. It fails 1 time in 20.",
  "functional": ["Other services can get coordinates for an address"],
  "load": [
    "1,500 requests a second, all reads",
    "Your API must fail at most 1% of the time, although the provider fails 5%"
  ],
  "given": [
    "The map provider takes 30 ms on average for one lookup and fails 5% of the time; you cannot change these",
    "Your code takes 5 ms on average for one request"
  ],
  "outOfScope": [
    "Checking the address format",
    "What the provider charges",
    "Changing to another provider"
  ],
  "scenario": {
    "schema": "loadsketch/scenario@1",
    "name": "Brief: address lookup",
    "seed": 1,
    "durationS": 60,
    "warmupS": 5,
    "traffic": { "rps": 1500, "readRatio": 1 }
  },
  "limits": { "maxErrorRate": 0.01, "maxP99Ms": 200, "budgetPerMonth": 1200, "maxPoints": 5 },
  "start": {
    "schema": "loadsketch/design@1",
    "name": "Brief: address lookup",
    "nodes": [
      { "id": "users", "kind": "client", "label": "Users", "pos": [0, 200] },
      {
        "id": "geo",
        "kind": "service",
        "label": "Map provider (outside)",
        "pos": [0, 380],
        "params": {
          "instances": 2,
          "concurrency": 64,
          "serviceMs": { "mean": 30, "cv": 0.5 },
          "queueLimit": 200,
          "errorRate": 0.05
        }
      }
    ],
    "edges": []
  },
  "fixed": ["geo"],
  "needs": [
    {
      "kind": "reaches-node",
      "node": "geo",
      "text": "Lookups reach the map provider",
      "op": "calls",
      "share": 0.05
    },
    { "kind": "not-degraded" }
  ],
  "hint": "Each call to the provider fails 5% of the time, and one failure does not depend on another. Try again after a failure: both fail 5% × 5% = 0.25% of the time. Set retries on the edge from the API to the map provider. Retries send the provider about 5% more requests, which it can take; if it failed because it was too busy, retries would make it worse.",
  "reference": {
    "schema": "loadsketch/design@1",
    "name": "Brief: address lookup",
    "nodes": [
      { "id": "users", "kind": "client", "label": "Users", "pos": [0, 200] },
      { "id": "lb", "kind": "load_balancer", "label": "Load balancer", "pos": [270, 200] },
      {
        "id": "api",
        "kind": "service",
        "label": "Address API",
        "pos": [540, 200],
        "params": { "instances": 3 }
      },
      {
        "id": "geo",
        "kind": "service",
        "label": "Map provider (outside)",
        "pos": [810, 200],
        "params": {
          "instances": 2,
          "concurrency": 64,
          "serviceMs": { "mean": 30, "cv": 0.5 },
          "queueLimit": 200,
          "errorRate": 0.05
        }
      }
    ],
    "edges": [
      { "from": "users", "to": "lb" },
      { "from": "lb", "to": "api" },
      { "from": "api", "to": "geo", "retries": 1 }
    ]
  },
  "naive": {
    "schema": "loadsketch/design@1",
    "name": "Brief: address lookup",
    "nodes": [
      { "id": "users", "kind": "client", "label": "Users", "pos": [0, 200] },
      { "id": "lb", "kind": "load_balancer", "label": "Load balancer", "pos": [270, 200] },
      {
        "id": "api",
        "kind": "service",
        "label": "Address API",
        "pos": [540, 200],
        "params": { "instances": 3 }
      },
      {
        "id": "geo",
        "kind": "service",
        "label": "Map provider (outside)",
        "pos": [810, 200],
        "params": {
          "instances": 2,
          "concurrency": 64,
          "serviceMs": { "mean": 30, "cv": 0.5 },
          "queueLimit": 200,
          "errorRate": 0.05
        }
      }
    ],
    "edges": [
      { "from": "users", "to": "lb" },
      { "from": "lb", "to": "api" },
      { "from": "api", "to": "geo" }
    ]
  }
}
